{"3561170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Leaks In Space", "steam_appid": 3561170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/8d1d456398327950b21c07a7f8284642.avif?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on this laid-back Space Simulation adventure as a lost Scavenger of a different star sector, who gitched into the Syntar system, you discover unusual phenomenon and learn about the Syntarians, a brilliant, now-extinct species of the Syntar system, all while seeking a way back to your home world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/9ee862d87d02c02027a029b22357351f.webp?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=50 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Scavenger's Ship: </i>Every build is a puzzle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship builder allows you to install crafted parts on the ship core. Buildable resources can be used to craft ship parts. Functional parts require Power Nodes which is a resource earned via quests and exploration. Save multiple ship designs and swap builds as needed. As you progress through the game, your ship core's Tier will be leveled up to Tier 2 and Tier 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/b5bfb65469dd6438781bb1497ca55167.poster.avif?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/b5bfb65469dd6438781bb1497ca55167.webm?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/b5bfb65469dd6438781bb1497ca55167.mp4?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f3d2f431d2e670561acff80d52fa4978.webp?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fight pirates, acidic slugmites, and rogue droids OR Flee to protect your ship's core!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your ship's integrity, internal pressure in an intense space combat. Each part on your ship has its own Armor points, Leak threshold and overall Hull point (Hp) which affect ship's combat capabilities and overall functionality. Use repair kits to rebuild the blueprint quickly in midair. Unlock high-tier railguns, shields, and turrets for better survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f7c0d555d29b7fc3386ee2de416515dd.poster.avif?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f7c0d555d29b7fc3386ee2de416515dd.webm?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f7c0d555d29b7fc3386ee2de416515dd.mp4?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure serves as a ship-wide life support system that is depleted by leaks or consumed to activate specific abilities. If Pressure reaches 0, it results in the death of the player or NPC ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/c20ee93eb79ba989236c208aeb2fa8d7.webp?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Serve the station. Earn its power!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every station has 3 expansion stages; each stage is reached progressively by completing station objectives. When a stage is reached, the station grows and grants the player one Power Node as a reward. Power Nodes are then used in ship building to unlock functional powered ship parts like shields, turrets, boosters, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/57ac5759bc4fb9fa6c2d845e09a00695.poster.avif?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/57ac5759bc4fb9fa6c2d845e09a00695.webm?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/57ac5759bc4fb9fa6c2d845e09a00695.mp4?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A bot at your service!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo-19 is a unique drone companion that will follow your ship and help you gather resources, lend a Lazor hand in combat or lighten the mood with slight humor as you wander the sectors of the Syntar System. It is invulnerable to damage and cannot be destroyed or disabled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/ee6475760f0206ed9438e12d741e00c