tras/f7c0d555d29b7fc3386ee2de416515dd.mp4?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure serves as a ship-wide life support system that is depleted by leaks or consumed to activate specific abilities. If Pressure reaches 0, it results in the death of the player or NPC ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/c20ee93eb79ba989236c208aeb2fa8d7.webp?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Serve the station. Earn its power!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every station has 3 expansion stages; each stage is reached progressively by completing station objectives. When a stage is reached, the station grows and grants the player one Power Node as a reward. Power Nodes are then used in ship building to unlock functional powered ship parts like shields, turrets, boosters, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/57ac5759bc4fb9fa6c2d845e09a00695.poster.avif?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/57ac5759bc4fb9fa6c2d845e09a00695.webm?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/57ac5759bc4fb9fa6c2d845e09a00695.mp4?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A bot at your service!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo-19 is a unique drone companion that will follow your ship and help you gather resources, lend a Lazor hand in combat or lighten the mood with slight humor as you wander the sectors of the Syntar System. It is invulnerable to damage and cannot be destroyed or disabled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/ee6475760f0206ed9438e12d741e00ce.poster.avif?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/ee6475760f0206ed9438e12d741e00ce.webm?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/ee6475760f0206ed9438e12d741e00ce.mp4?t=1788281924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/c76b273b234ba9bd190b3023e9088653.webp?t=1788281924\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "short_description": "Build your own spaceship. Protect ship's core, manage Hull &amp; Pressure to survive. Fight pirates. Explore themed sectors of the Syntar System. Uncover the mysterious of the Syntarian Empire!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/b210bb8428fe375e912f1ca5b893a3bf2334cb77/header.jpg?t=1788281924", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/c9356f8a2ecd36d62abbc87fe03bebef723a4a86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788281924", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/c9356f8a2ecd36d62abbc87fe03bebef723a4a86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788281924", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">